rother and  sister but twins engaged in a passionate  smooch my there all of which is to say  look fans we can all gripe about the  sequels merit of not being consistent  but let's apply a little consistency  ourselves the new flicks may have been a  bit confused about Ray and Ren's  relationship but at least they never  forced us to watch twin siblings making  out check out one of our newest videos  right here plus even more looper videos  about your favorite stuff are coming  soon subscribe to our YouTube channel  and hit the bell so you don't miss a  single one  [Music]
 

